  "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-jc9p6xxw alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-14d659c animated fadeInLeftBig\" data-block-id=\"14d659c\"><style>.stk-14d659c .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:367px !important;}.stk-14d659c .stk-img-wrapper img{border-radius:98px !important;}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-499\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-scaled.jpg 1707w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-200x300.jpg 200w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hands-working-with-laptop-1365x2048.jpg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1707px) 100vw, 1707px\" /></span></figure></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container animated backInRight uagb-block-r1etekyw\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ate5k8ax uagb-infobox__content-wrap  uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Consultanță IT digitalizare</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Dacă te afli în etapa de explorare a digitalizării sau ai deja un proiect în desfășurare, consultarea cu experți din industria IT sau a specialiștilor în consultanță în afaceri reprezintă un pas esențial pentru a asigura succesul inițiativei tale digitale. <br><br>Prin colaborarea cu acești specialiști, vei putea identifica o strategie eficientă de digitalizare, beneficiind de perspective relevante asupra tendințelor actuale din domeniul tehnologic.<br><br>Consultanța lor poate acoperi diverse aspecte, de la selecția tehnologiilor potrivite la optimizarea proceselor operaționale, contribuind astfel la transformarea digitală reușită a afacerii tale.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-wrapper alignfull  root-eb-wrapper-zvxn78a\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-wrapper-zvxn78a \"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-outer eb-wrapper-zvxn78a\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner-blocks eb-wrapper-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-row alignfull  root-eb-row-z63ezlv\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-row-z63ezlv \"><div class=\"eb-row-root-container eb-row-z63ezlv\" data-id=\"eb-row-z63ezlv\"><div class=\"eb-row-wrapper\"><div class=\"eb-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-eqbg4kg\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-eqbg4kg \"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-eqbg4kg\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-9ca3a17\" data-block-id=\"9ca3a17\"><style>.stk-9ca3a17 .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:379px !important;}.stk-9ca3a17 .stk-img-wrapper img{border-radius:24px !important;}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-651\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-300x200.jpg 300w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-768x512.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/group-young-business-people-working-office-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></span></figure></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-9kwzjib\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-9kwzjib eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInRight\"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-9kwzjib\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading  root-eb-advance-heading-5y0xi9l\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-5y0xi9l \"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-advance-heading-5y0xi9l button-1 undefined\" data-id=\"eb-advance-heading-5y0xi9l\"><h2 class=\"eb-ah-title\"><span class=\"first-title\">Ce servicii oferim ?</span></h2><p class=\"eb-ah-subtitle\"><strong>• Analiza fezabilității digitalizării uneia sau mai multor activități dintre cele autorizate: se stabilesc activitatile specifice care pot beneficia de programul de digitalizare;<br><br>• Colectare, interpretare și validare informații privind indicatorii DESI (Digital Economy &amp; Society Index) la momentul analizei se analizeaza fiecare indicator DESI;</strong><br></p></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-lsi9dpa\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-lsi9dpa eb_animation eb___animated eb___slideInUp\"><div class=\"eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-lsi9dpa\"><div class=\"eb-button\"><div class=\"eb-button-inner-wrapper \"><a class=\"eb-button-anchor \" href=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/contact/\" rel=\"noopener\">Contactează-ne</a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-row alignfull  root-eb-row-jyfyvo2\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-row-jyfyvo2 \"><div class=\"eb-row-root-container eb-row-jyfyvo2\" data-id=\"eb-row-jyfyvo2\"><div class=\"eb-row-wrapper\"><div class=\"eb-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-5and6f6\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-5and6f6 eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInLeft\"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-5and6f6\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading  root-eb-advance-heading-i6rv0sm\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-i6rv0sm \"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-advance-heading-i6rv0sm button-1 undefined\" data-id=\"eb-advance-heading-i6rv0sm\"><p class=\"eb-ah-title\"><span class=\"first-title\">• Propunere minim 1 soluție de digitalizare, cu detalierea domeniilor de aplicare;<br><br>• Studiu de fezabilitate digitală conform cu cerințele din Ghidul PR Nord-Est Transformarea digitală a IMM-urilor orientată către creșterea intensității digitale;<br><br>• Suport pentru realizarea studiului de piață (minim 2 oferte) aferente soluțiilor de digitalizare propuse;</span></p></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-59h33zh\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-59h33zh \"><div class=\"eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-59h33zh\"><div class=\"eb-button\"><div class=\"eb-button-inner-wrapper \"><a class=\"eb-button-anchor \" href=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro